  "description": "NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE. Enquiries via daft.ie only. \n\nInterested parties need to click on the ad for the relevant property within this development page to be able to send an email query. Please do not contact either the Comer Group Ireland or Comer Group UK head office regarding lettings, as these are handled via the lettings department directly. Any queries through the main office will be disregarded. \n\nComer Group Ireland is delighted to bring to the rental market this stunning 1 bedroom / 1 bathroom, fully furnished apartment in Rathbaun House, Loughrea. The apartment is fitted out to a high standard and is situated 30 minutes from Galway City Centre. Property consists of one double bedroom, one bathroom, hot press, wooden floors and a kitchen which opens onto a large private balcony. House comes fully furnished - double bed, mattress and bedside lockers in the bedrooms, as well as a sofa, coffee table, TV stand and kitchen table and chairs in the living area. The apartment has a modern kitchen area with high quality appliances including built in cooker hob and stainless-steel extractor fan, oven, fridge/freezer, washer/dryer, microwave. \nThe house has private surface car parking (parking space included in the rent). Refuse is included. Utilities not included. Connections available for tv/internet, but tenants need to arrange for their own tv/internet supply (not included in rental price). \n\nNO PETS ALLOWED.\n",
